er:created` and `order:status_changed` events\n41\t- Export: `createOrderService(bus: EventBus): OrderService`\n42\t\n43\t### src/payment/index.ts - Payment Processing\n44\t- Async payment processing with configurable success/failure/timeout simulation\n45\t- Refund support for successful transactions\n46\t- Emits `payment:processed` events\n47\t- Export: `createPaymentService(bus: EventBus, options?: PaymentServiceOptions): PaymentService`\n48\t\n49\t### src/notifications/index.ts - Notification System\n50\t- User subscription model\n51\t- Listens for `order:status_changed` and `payment:processed` events\n52\t- Collects notifications per subscribed user\n53\t- Emits `notification:sent` events\n54\t- Export: `createNotificationService(bus: EventBus): NotificationService`\n55\t\n56\t### src/analytics/index.ts - Analytics Tracking\n57\t- Event counting by type\n58\t- Revenue tracking from successful payments\n59\t- Conversion rate calculation (orders / unique carts)\n60\t- Top products ranking by order quantity\n61\t- Listens for all major event types\n62\t- Export: `createAnalyticsService(bus: EventBus): AnalyticsService`\n63\t\n64\t## Constraints\n65\t\n66\t- **DO NOT modify** `src/bus.ts` or `src/types.ts` (checksums are validated)\n67\t- Each service must take `(bus: EventBus)` as its constructor parameter (payment also accepts options)\n68\t- Services must NOT import from each other's directories\n69\t- Services communicate ONLY through the event bus\n70\t- Each service function is a factory that returns the service interface\n71\t\n72\t## Validation\n73\t\n74\t```bash\n75\tnpm test        # All 70 tests must pass\n76\tnpm run build   # TypeScript must compile\n77\tnpm run lint    # No lint errors\n78\t```\n79\t\n80\t## Event Flow\n81\t\n82\t```\n83\tcatalog --[product:created]--> pricing (tracks prices)\n84\tinventory --[inventory:updated]--> (bus log)\n85\tinventory --[inventory:low_stock]--> (bus log)\n86\tcart --[cart:updated]--> (bus log)\n87\torders --[order:created]--> notifications (maps userId), analytics (tracks)\n88\torders --[order:status_changed]--> notifications (sends notif)\n89\tpayment --[payment:processed]--> notifications (sends notif), analytics (tracks revenue)\n90\tanalytics --[analytics:event]--> (bus log)\n91\tnotifications --[notification:sent]--> (bus log)\n92\t```\n93\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3524d844-b295-412c-b6f1-b15e1c645a8f","uuid":"b4032cbe-ae32-4b38-a050-8c981addfb63","timestamp":"2026-06-30T19:53:40.087Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/workspace/TASK.md","content":"# T10: E-Commerce Backend\n\n**Category:** greenfield/complex\n**Timeout:** 45 minutes\n**Tests:** 48 unit (6 per service) + 22 integration = 70 total\n\n## Overview\n\nBuild an event-driven e-commerce backend with 8 independent services communicating through a read-only event bus. Each service implements a specific interface defined in `src/types.ts` and communicates with other services exclusively through events on the shared `EventBus` from `src/bus.ts`.\n\n## What to Build\n\nImplement 8 services, each in its own directory under `src/`:\n\n### src/catalog/index.ts - Product Catalog\n- CRUD operations for products (create, get, list, search, update, remove)\n- Emits `product:created` events\n- Export: `createCatalogService(bus: EventBus): CatalogService`\n\n### src/inventory/index.ts - Inventory Management\n- Stock tracking with set, get, reserve, release operations\n- Low stock alert system with configurable thresholds\n- Emits `inventory:updated` and `inventory:low_stock` events\n- Export: `createInventoryService(bus: EventBus): InventoryService`\n\n### src/cart/index.ts - Shopping Cart\n- Cart creation, item add/remove/update, clear operations\n- Emits `cart:updated` events on any cart modification\n- Export: `createCartService(bus: EventBus): CartService`\n\n### src/pricing/index.ts - Price Calculation\n- Calculate totals with 10% tax rate\n- Discount code support (percentage-ba